There are many duplicate lines in the data.txt file.
Use sort to arrange them.
uniq can only read adjacent duplicate lines. If the duplicate lines are not adjacent, it will count them as unique.
Use pipe | to complete the command together.
command I used [sort data.txt| uniq -u] , -u prints unique line.
